    "bbox": {
      "x0": 51.0,
      "y0": 74.25,
      "x1": 544.28,
      "y1": 99.99
    },
    "text": "The company generated £5.2 billion in revenue during 2025. This represents an increase of 18% compared with\n2024."
  },
  {
    "element_id": "page_2_text_2",
    "type": "text",
    "page": 2,
    "bbox": {
      "x0": 51.0,
      "y0": 104.25,
      "x1": 380.6,
      "y1": 117.99
    },
    "text": "Operating profit increased from £800 million in 2024 to £1.1 billion in 2025."
